# Frontend Structure & Development Rules

You are an expert frontend architect specializing in Next.js App Router, TypeScript, and clean modular architecture. Follow these rules to maintain a minimal app directory structure while maximizing code organization and minimizing cognitive complexity.

## Core Architecture Principles

### 1. **Minimal App Directory**
- App directory (`src/app/`) should ONLY contain routing structure, not business logic
- Every page.tsx and layout.tsx MUST be Server Components
- No client-side logic, hooks, or complex state management in app directory
- Maximum 10-15 lines per page.tsx file (imports + component call + metadata export)

### 2. **Modular Design Pattern**
- All UI components, business logic, and features live in `src/modules/`
- Each module represents a complete feature domain
- Modules are self-contained with their own components, hooks, types, and logic
- Cross-module dependencies should be minimal and explicit

### 3. **Cognitive Complexity Reduction**
- Single Responsibility Principle: One component, one purpose
- Favor composition over inheritance
- Keep component files under 200 lines
- Extract custom hooks for complex logic
- Use TypeScript strictly for better IntelliSense and error catching

## Directory Structure Standards

### App Directory Structure
```
src/app/
├── layout.tsx                 # Root layout (Server Component)
├── page.tsx                   # Home page (Server Component)
├── globals.css                # Global styles only
├── provider.tsx               # Client-side providers wrapper
├── (routes)/
│   ├── (protected)/           # Protected route group
│   │   ├── layout.tsx         # Protected layout (Server Component)
│   │   ├── dashboard/
│   │   │   └── page.tsx       # Dashboard page (Server Component)
│   │   └── profile/
│   │       └── page.tsx       # Profile page (Server Component)
│   └── (unprotected)/         # Public route group
│       ├── sign-in/
│       │   └── page.tsx       # Sign-in page (Server Component)
│       └── about/
│           └── page.tsx       # About page (Server Component)
├── api/                       # API routes only
│   └── v1/
│       ├── auth/
│       └── users/
└── action/                    # Server actions only
    └── auth.ts
```

### Modules Directory Structure
```
src/modules/
├── {feature-name}/
│   ├── components/            # Feature-specific UI components
│   │   ├── {FeatureName}Page.tsx    # Main page component
│   │   ├── {Component}Form.tsx      # Forms
│   │   ├── {Component}Card.tsx      # Cards/display components
│   │   └── index.ts                 # Export barrel
│   ├── hooks/                 # Feature-specific custom hooks
│   │   ├── use-{feature}.ts
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── types/                 # Feature-specific types
│   │   └── index.ts
│   └── utils/                 # Feature-specific utilities (optional)
│       └── {feature}-utils.ts
```
